# DUNE EXPRESS: with two outlaws on the train they take a turn each, one
# moving while the other waits; there is no button to swap them. With no
# lawman up to take a turn, the turns still pass straight from one outlaw to
# the other, so nobody is left behind.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 10
wait 2
expect who == 0
expect phase == 1
press SELECT
expect who == 0
wait 596
expect phase == 2
wait 212
expect phase == 1
expect who == 1
cheat mission 10
cheat clear_law
wait 2
expect phase == 1
expect who == 0
wait 600
expect phase == 1
expect who == 1
